   "title": "About this workflow",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "The outlines (Canny edges) of the input picture guide the new picture: same shapes and layout, new content and style.\nEdge thresholds: lower = more edges. The Edges preview shows what the ControlNet sees.\nThe output takes the input's shape at about 1.0 megapixels (Output size).\nControlNet strength 0.8; End = when it lets go (0.8 leaves the last steps free for detail).\nModel file: t2i-adapter-canny-sdxl-1.0.safetensors.\n\nModel: SDXL checkpoints; Illustrious and Pony models work too (use their prompt style). Default: Juggernaut XL.\nDefaults: 30 steps, CFG 5.0, dpmpp_2m_sde / karras."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
